# Gitignore settings for ESPHome
# This is an example and may include too much for your use-case.
# You can modify this file to suit your needs.
/.esphome/
/secrets.yaml
# Catch editor/tooling backups of the secrets file, which the bare path above misses.
secrets*.yaml*
*.bak
# ...but the placeholder template is meant to be public.
!secrets.yaml.example
